 "name_en": "Contract Accounting – Contract-Based Revenue Recognition (3L3)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Contract Accounting – Contract-Based Revenue Recognition (3L3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio32e99a553dea4dbdb94391bff4ebd157\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio32e99a553dea4dbdb94391bff4ebd157__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this scope item, you integrate contract-based revenue recognition with Convergent Contract Accounting (FI-CAC). You can create provider contracts with service-based products and invoice documents. A back-end service transfers revenue accounting items to contract-based revenue recognition. In addition, you can make a change scenario to provider contracts such as upsell, cross sell, down sell, renewal, and so on.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio32e99a553dea4dbdb94391bff4ebd157__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create provider contract with service-based product</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create invoice document</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update provider contract</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer revenue accounting items to revenue accounting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display revenue accounting items</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio32e99a553dea4dbdb94391bff4ebd157__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Get end-to-end scenarios from contract accounting to revenue recognition</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get complete lifecycle change scenarios for provider contracts</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>合同会计核算 - 基于合同的收入确认 (3L3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio32e99a553dea4dbdb94391bff4ebd157\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio32e99a553dea4dbdb94391bff4ebd157__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此范围项目中，将基于合同的收入确认与 Convergent Contract Accounting (FI-CAC) 集成。您可以使用基于服务的产品和发票凭证创建供方合同。后端服务将收入会计核算项目传输到基于合同的收入确认。此外，您可以对供方合同进行变更场景，例如追加销售、交叉销售、降等销售、续订等。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio32e99a553dea4dbdb94391bff4ebd157__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用基于服务的产品创建供方合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建发票凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">更新供方合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将收入会计核算项目传输到收入会计核算</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示收入会计核算项目</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio32e99a553dea4dbdb94391bff4ebd157__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">获取从合同会计到收入确认的端到端场景</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获取供方合同的完整生命周期更改场景</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
